title: "Soma Quantification"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based counting of neuronal somata in fluorescence microscopy images (ND2, TIFF, PNG, JPEG),
  with trained cell classifiers, hand correction, colocalisation of merged channels and per-region
  counts.
type: software
